<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Message Received — LifeLine</title>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6f8; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1558c0 0%, #1d6fe8 60%, #4285f4 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 28px 30px; text-align: center; }
    .header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; }
    .content { padding: 30px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .highlight { background: #e8f0fd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; color: #1558c0; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; }
    .footer { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #777777; }
    a { color: #1d6fe8; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>✅ Message Received</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong> 👋</p>
      <p>Thank you for contacting us. We have received your message and our team will get back to you within <strong>1-2 business days</strong>.</p>
      <div class="highlight">
        Subject: "<%= subject %>"
      </div>
      <p>If you have any urgent issues, please contact us directly at <a href="mailto:support@lifeline.com">support@lifeline.com</a>.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br/><strong>The LifeLine Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> LifeLine Medical Platform. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
